==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|другъ}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|Ru-друг.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}

===Etymology 1===
{{PIE root|ru|dʰrewgʰ|id=serve}}
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*drugъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*dʰrowgʰos}}. Cognate with {{cog|lt|draũgas||friend}}, {{cog|got|𐌲𐌰𐌳𐍂𐌰𐌿𐌷𐍄𐍃||warrior}} and {{cog|ang|drihten}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|c||-ья(2)|друз|voc=дру́же|a=an|f=подру́га}}

# close [[friend]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[хотеть|хочу́]] [[име́ть]] '''друзе́й'''.|I want to have friends.}}
#:* {{uxi|ru|[[бли́зкий]] '''друг'''|close friend}}
#:* {{uxi|ru|[[стари́нный]] '''друг'''|very old friend}}
#:* {{uxi|ru|'''друг''' [[дом|до́ма]]|friend of the family}}
#:* {{uxi|ru|'''друг''' [[детство|де́тства]]|childhood friend}}

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|c||-ья(2)|друз|voc=дру́же|a=an}}

