* {{l|ru|това́рищ}}
* {{l|ru|френд|tr=frɛnd}} {{qualifier|slang, in social networks or neologism}}
* {{l|ru|ко́реш}} {{qualifier|slang, especially criminal}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|ru|враг}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|lang=ru|{{l|ru|дру́жба||friendship}}
|{{l|ru|дру́жеский}}
