|{{l|ru|дру́жный||friendly, amicable, personable; harmonious, concurrent, unanimous}}
|{{l|ru|подру́га||female friend}}}}

===Etymology 2===
Originally, '''друг''' was the predicative (short) form of [[другой]] (“another”).

